    "body": "The release build was not a valid non-development baseline: normal prone entry was unavailable. Dev mode must control only authoring tools, editor controls, and diagnostics; it must never decide whether a gameplay feature is dispatched. The current source reads Prone.Enabled independently and gates only Prone.DevelopmentTrace, but the release artifact did not preserve that behavior. I am adding a dev/release gameplay-parity check before another build.",
